OL,3,GNEWSAEast West Rail plan for 900
OL,4,ABedford parking spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 900 new parking spaces across
OL,7,Fthree car parks in Bedford have been
OL,8,Fproposed as part of the East West Rail
OL,9,F(EWR) project.
OL,11,FEast West Rail Company (EWR Co) said
OL,12,F70% of the spaces would be to the east
OL,13,Fof Bedford station in a six-storey car
OL,14,Fpark and a surface car park, both on
OL,15,FAshburnham Road.
OL,17,FThe remaining spaces would be in a car
OL,18,Fpark off Ford End Road.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
