OL,3,GNEWSAEast West Rail plan for 900
OL,4,ABedford parking spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Hughes, EWR Co chief executive,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We believe these proposals
OL,8,Fstrike the right balance for Bedford.
OL,9,FIt provides the parking capacity needed
OL,10,Ffor a growing railway, while ensuring
OL,11,Ftraffic is spread more evenly across
OL,12,Fthe town."
